        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbiza Nazili kūlī SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga nabo a Baisilaeli ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū munhū ngosha nūūlū nkīma wikomanya wei ng'wenekīlī kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, hūna ūlahīla gīkī atogilwe kwifunya kūbiza Nazili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nazili:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'wihanga lya Baisilaeli banhū bamò balahīlaga kwilecha mihayo ya kūyeja mīlī, gīkī babize beela kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Ī shilahīlo shenīsho ī hingī shaalī sh'ikanza iguhī, alīyo bangī balahīlaga kūlwa shikū jose ū mu būlamu wabo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shing'wigelile ileche gete ū kūng'wa ī divai, nūūlū walwa, nūūlū kūtūmamīla ng'aasha ya kūbeejiwa kūfuma mu shikolo shose shose. Yaya nūūlū kūng'wa minzī ga mizabibu, nūūlū kūlya matwajo ga mizabibu; gabize madoto nūūlū mūūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyose īlo alī Nazili, atizūūlya matwajo gose gose ga nzabibu; yaya nūūlū madūūtū gaho dūhū, pye na a mūūla gaho yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū ng'wikanza lyakwe lya kwikomanya, atizūūmoogwa ī nzwīlī jakwe nūūlū hado. Līl'ikanza lya kūjileka ī nzwīlī jakwe jikūle. Ū ng'wikanza lya kwikomanya kwakwe kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, shing'wigeleelilwe kwikala ng'wela kūshisha līshile ī likanza lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya kwikomanya kwakwe ī lyose, atazunīlījiwe kwegeela ha mimba gose gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ise wa kūmyala ūzumalīka, nūūlū nina, nūūlū ng'wana wa ng'wawe ngosha nūūlū nkīma; yaya gete ū kwisosohaja kūlwa nguno yabo, nguno ū lūmeeng'ho lwa kwikomanya kwakwe kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA lūlī ha ntwe gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyose ī lya kwikomanya kwakwe, alī ng'wela kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī hamò nang'hwe hūna ūcha bo kūng'wisanganīja, ūbiza wajisosohaja ī nzwīlī jakwe ījo jikeejiwa h'ikanza lya kwifunya kwakwe kūlī SEEBA, īkūng'wigeleelwa kūjimooga ī nzwīlī jenījo ha lūshikū lwa mpungatī, ū lwa kwejiwa kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ha lūshikū lwa kanaane wenha mhunda ibīlī, nūūlū ng'hune ibīlī ja ng'hūūlū; wiza najo a ha nyango gw'iheema lya kwibilingīla, ūng'winha ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūjifunya kūbiza shakwinha, īmò shitambò kūlwa būkenaagūji, ī yīngī shitambò sha kūpemva kūlwa kūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno yakwe, kūlwa būhūbi wa kūbiza bbihī na mimba. Ū lūshikū lwenūlo akwifunya būpya kūlī SEEBA, gweejiwa hangī ū ntwe gwakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlyandya hangī būpya ī likanza lya kwikomanya kwakwe kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA. Īkūng'wigeleelwa kūfunya ng'ondi ya ng'waka gūmò kūlwa nguno ya shitambò sha būkenaagūji. Ī shikū ja kwikomanya kwakwe ū ng'wikanza īlo lyabītaga jitūbalwa, jikūcha mpandagīlo; nguno ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo walī wasosohalile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī shilagīlo īsho shiigelile kūtūmama kūlwa ng'wa Nazili ūlū ūlīkalīcha ī likanza lyakwe, shiishi. Akwenhwa a ha nyango gw'iheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shakwe kūlī SEEBA akūshenha henaho, akwenha ng'ondi ya ng'waka gūmò, īyo ītī na būka; ya kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemva. Na ng'holo ng'hīma ya shitambò sha būkenaagūji, nayo ya ng'waka gūmò, hama ītī na būka; hamò na ng'ondi, nayo ītī na būka, ya shitambò sha būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūshenha ī shenīshi hamò na shakwinha shaho sha būsu na sha kūng'wiwa; wiza na shigabbu sha migatī ya būsu būtī na shibimbya, na keki ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta, na migatī myūūmu ībililwe maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūshifunya pyī ī shose kūbiza shakwinha kūlī SEEBA, ūshifunya ī shitambò sha būkenaagūji nī sha kūpemva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūshegeleja kūlī SEEBA nī shigabbu sha migatī ya būsu būtī na shibimba, nī ng'ondi ya shitambò sha būsangī wīfunya, hamò nī shakwinha shaho ī sha būsu, nī sha kūng'wiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Nazili ūjimooga hangī ī nzwīlī ījo jalī ū kū ntwe gwakwe aho alitūūla būpya kūlī SEEBA; ūjikuminga ūjiponeja mu moto, ūyo gūlībaka a ha sīlīlī ya shitambò sha būsangī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Nazili ūlū ūmala kūjimooga ī nzwīlī ja kūfuma h'ikanza lya kwifunya kwalwe kūlī SEEBA, ū ngabīji akūng'winha nkono gwa ng'ondi gūzugile. Ū mu shigabbu ūsola mo keki na ngatī ng'ūūmu; ī shose shibeejiwe na būsu būtī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūshiyengeeja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ī shenīsho, shibize shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa; ī shoi shilī sheela, īlī sabo ya ngabīji, hamò nī shidali sha kūyengeejiwa, nī litango īlo lyalī lyafunyiwagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA. Ūlū yūshila ī yenīyo, ū Nazili adūgije kwandya kūng'wa ī divai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo shenīshi sha kūtūmamīlwa kūlwa Nazili ūyo ūfunya kūlahīla kwakwe kūlī SEEBA. Ī shakwinha shakwe akūshifunya kūlenganīla na kūlahīla kūlwa kwikomanya kwakwe; kūleka ū kūshibala ī shakwinha ī shingī īsho adūgije kūshifunya. Shiigelile ashikīlīje ūmo alahīlīlile kūlwa nguno ya kwikomanya kwakwe kūbiza Nazili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngabīji na kūfuuha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
